## Claude Code

- Subagents `Explore`, `implementer`, `reviewer`, `ci-fixer` in `.claude/agents/` (reports ≤ 15 lines).
- Skills: `ready`, `verify`, `add-piece`{% if "docs" in pieces %}, `docs-lookup`{% endif %}. `/loop` runs `.claude/loop.md`.
- Hooks: `guard.mjs` denies publish, force, tag and default-branch pushes, `gh pr merge` without `--auto` and secret reads, and asks before editing
  template-owned files; `stop-checks.sh` is opt-in (`HULL_STOP_CHECKS=1`).
